Even with the most meticulous budgeting, a few unexpected costs are bound to occur.

113
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:31,080
While most brides tend to accept this as fact, one Canadian woman, who is only known

114
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:34,800
as Susan, attempted to avoid all wedding costs.

115
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:39,800
She did this by asking her friends and family to pay up to attend her wedding.

116
