went about as well as you'd expect.

117
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:49,440
Susan is causing quite the debate online after posting a bizarre Facebook complaint

118
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:51,580
about her now -cancelled wedding.

119
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:57,380
Yes, the couple called off the wedding just days before their wedding vows.

120
00:07:57,920 --> 00:08:05,060
Since the guests refused to pay the $1,500 attendance fee, the $60,000 dream wedding

121
