friends and family of ruining her marriage and her life.

124
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:23,480
She stated that each guest would only need to pay $1,500 while she sacrificed

125
00:08:23,480 --> 00:08:24,760
everything for the day.

126
00:08:25,300 --> 00:08:30,160
Her maid of honor told her to stick to the budget as she was asking too much from

127
